{"headword":"שִׁבְעִים","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.pl. seventy (</strong>irreg. pl. of <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁבַע</span> Ges<sup>§ 97 f. R. 1</sup><strong>)</strong>;—not decl.:—<em>seventy</em> (often as round no., cf. Kö<sup>Hast.DB number, 563 a</sup>):"},{"senses":[{"definition":"without other no.:"},{"senses":[{"definition":"before n. s. year <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:12\" href=\"/Genesis.5.12\">Gn 5:12</a> + 12 times, man <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:2\" href=\"/Judges.9.2\">Ju 9:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:25\" href=\"/Numbers.11.25\">Nu 11:25</a> + 7 times, shekel <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:13\" href=\"/Numbers.7.13\">7:13</a> + 11 times, other n. 5 times"}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"before n.pl. kings <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:7\" href=\"/Judges.1.7\">Ju 1:7</a>, sons <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:30\" href=\"/Judges.8.30\">8:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:24\" href=\"/Judges.9.24\">9:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.1\">2 K 10:1</a>, brothers <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:56\" href=\"/Judges.9.56\">Ju 9:56</a>, asses <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:14\" href=\"/Judges.12.14\">12:14</a>, palms <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:27\" href=\"/Exodus.15.27\">Ex 15:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:9\" href=\"/Numbers.33.9\">Nu 33:9</a>, males <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:7\" href=\"/Ezra.8.7\">Ezr 8:7</a>,<a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:14\" href=\"/Ezra.8.14\">14</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"after n. coll. <span dir=\"rtl\">(בָּקָר)</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:32\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.32\">2 Ch 29:32</a>, n.pl. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:24\" href=\"/Daniel.9.24\">Dn 9:24</a>."}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"pred. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:27\" href=\"/Genesis.46.27\">Gn 46:27</a>."}],"num":"d."},{"senses":[{"definition":"n. om. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:1\" href=\"/Exodus.24.1\">Ex 24:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:9\" href=\"/Exodus.24.9\">9</a> (man), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:85\" href=\"/Numbers.7.85\">Nu 7:85</a> (shekel), cf. <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:4\" href=\"/Judges.9.4\">Ju 9:4</a>"}],"num":"e."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ אֶלֶף</span> = 70,000 <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.15\">2 S 24:15</a> + 6 times."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"+ other num.:"},{"senses":[{"definition":"+ unit + n. s. <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:14\" href=\"/Judges.8.14\">Ju 8:14</a>; n. om. 70 + 7 (times) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:24\" href=\"/Genesis.4.24\">Gn 4:24</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:40\" href=\"/Ezra.2.40\">Ezr 2:40</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:42\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.42\">Ne 7:43</a>, so 2 + 70 <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:38\" href=\"/Numbers.31.38\">Nu 31:38</a>; n.pl. + 70 + 7 <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:35\" href=\"/Ezra.8.35\">Ezr 8:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:5\" href=\"/Ezra.8.5\">5</a> years + 70 year <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:4\" href=\"/Genesis.12.4\">Gn 12:4</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"5 + 70 × 1000 (man) <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:16\" href=\"/Esther.9.16\">Est 9:16</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:4\" href=\"/Numbers.2.4\">Nu 2:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:43\" href=\"/Numbers.3.43\">3:43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:32\" href=\"/Numbers.26.32\">26:32</a>; 2 + 70 × 1000 <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:33\" href=\"/Numbers.31.33\">31:33</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">בָּקָר</span> precedes); 70 man, 50 × 1000 man <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.19\">1 S 6:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.7\">7</a> + 70 year + 7 × 100 year <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:31\" href=\"/Genesis.5.31\">Gn 5:31</a>; n. om. 3 + 70 + 200 <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:46\" href=\"/Numbers.3.46\">Nu 3:46</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"70 foll. hundreds: 70 year + 5 years <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:7\" href=\"/Genesis.25.7\">Gn 25:7</a>, and (n. om.) 70 + 2 <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:3\" href=\"/Ezra.2.3\">Ezr 2:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:4\" href=\"/Ezra.2.4\">4</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.8\">Ne 7:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.19\">Ne 11:19</a>; + 3 <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:36\" href=\"/Ezra.2.36\">Ezr 2:36</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:38\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.38\">Ne 7:39</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.5\">5</a> + 70 <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:5\" href=\"/Ezra.2.5\">Ezr 2:5</a>."}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"1000 + 7 × 100 + 5 + 70 shekel <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:25\" href=\"/Exodus.38.25\">Ex 38:25</a> and (n. om.) v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:28\" href=\"/Exodus.38.28\">28</a>."}],"num":"d."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB09914","strong_numbers":["7657"],"next_hw":"שְׁבִיעִי","prev_hw":"שִׁבְעָה","occurrences":"91","quotes":[],"GK":["8684"],"TWOT":["2318a","2318b"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}